  "property": {
    "kind": "kernel_release_acquire_publication_ordering",
    "claim": "On the configured SMP x86-64 profile, if trace_find_tgid_ptr() observes the non-NULL tgid_map value published by a successful trace_alloc_tgid_map(), its following tgid_map_max access cannot observe the pre-publication zero value.",
